# Frontend

Full guide: `@docs/standards/FRONTEND.md` · Conventions: `@docs/standards/CONVENTIONS.md` · Playbook: `@docs/standards/ADDING_A_FEATURE.md`

## Layout

- **Clinic target:** `app/` · `pages/{domain}/` · `features/{domain}/` · `shared/`
- **Dashboard:** keep `pages/`, `components/`, `lib/` — do not invent a third shape
- Domain API via named exports + `apiFetch` (`features/{domain}/api.ts`)
- Imports: `@/` alias → `src/`

## Must follow

- Do **not** add new feature panels inside `app/App.tsx`; put screens under `pages/`
- A UI change must not require staff to re-enter server data; desks do not migrate SQLite
- View/page string unions only — no React Router
- Local `useState`/`useEffect` — no Redux/Zustand/React Query by default
- New UI strings: EN + MY keys in `i18n.ts`
- Storage: clinic `mudita_*` · dashboard `mudita_dash_*` — never mix
- JSON types: `snake_case`, money `*_mmk`
- Print through existing server HTML + `print.ts` overlay

## Clinic UI (`client/` only)

Full pattern: `@docs/standards/FRONTEND.md` → **Clinic design system**.

- New desk list/toolbar actions → `.btn.action` + `ActionIcon` when the metaphor is clear; outline danger (`.btn.action.danger`), not solid red fills on lists/rails
- Panel / detail title-row dismiss → `DialogCloseButton` (icon ×), not `desk-text-link` Cancel/Close — see FRONTEND **Icons**
- Overlays / modals → `.clinic-overlay` + `.clinic-overlay-panel` (scrim + shadow, no blur) — see FRONTEND **Overlays / modals**
- Bill desks → extend `.opd-bill-desk` tokens and `.opd-bill-rail-btn` (accent / outline / danger); do not invent a second rail
- Form Save/Create may stay `.btn.primary` where that matches an existing form footer
- **Do not** apply this system to `dashboard/`

## Reference apps

Dashboard modular layout is the clinic migration target. Copy OPD for simple bills, OT for multi-step, Pharmacy for stock. Match nearest clinic screen for action buttons (Drug Setup / bill rail), not the dashboard.
